    "title": "People Are Driving Across Missouri for the Insanely Delicious Brunch at This Homey Spot - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Asher Bennett ,\n10 hours ago You know those places that people can’t stop talking about until you finally go and realize the hype is actually real? This is one of those spots. It is a total dream for anyone who believes brunch is the most important meal of the week, offering the kind of comfort food that feels like a warm hug. Even with all the great local eats we have in Missouri, the hospitality and the legendary desserts here are in a league of their own. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
